#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""infer (lite) — stdlib-only LLM gateway. No Docker, no LiteLLM.

Single Python file (Python 3.11+). Listens on localhost:4000 and forwards
OpenAI-shape requests to provider /v1/chat/completions and /v1/embeddings
endpoints with the user's free keys. Streams SSE through. No master key,
no config.yaml regeneration.

Usage:
    ./infer keys add <provider> <key>
    ./infer serve              # blocks; Ctrl-C to stop
    ./infer probe              # smoke-test every alias against upstreams
    ./infer wire cc | opencode | pi | openclaw | hermes
"""
